Package: BPFC
Title: Bayesian MCMC Functional Clustering for Paired Longitudinal Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ruiqi", "Zhao", email = "karongzrq@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Ruiqi Zhao [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Ruiqi Zhao <karongzrq@163.com>
Description: Bayesian finite mixture clustering of paired longitudinal
    profiles using fourth-order Legendre mean trajectories and a shared
    bivariate first-order structured antedependence covariance. Both within-state
    and cross-state lagged residual dependence and time-dependent correlated
    innovations are modeled. Inference uses the 'nimble' engine with categorical,
    conjugate Dirichlet, adaptive block random-walk Metropolis and univariate
    slice updates. ECR relabeling precedes posterior summaries. Overfitted
    mixtures and supplementary posterior point-estimate BIC are supported.
